## Lesson JSON Schema

This is the core contract between the AI and the visualiser. The schema must be rich enough to express complex multi-step animations, but structured enough that an AI can reliably generate it.

### Top-Level Structure

```json
{
  "version": "1.0",
  "title": "Solving Quadratic Equations by Completing the Square",
  "description": "Learn to transform any quadratic equation into vertex form.",
  "topics": ["algebra", "quadratics"],
  "colorPalette": {
    "x_term": { "hex": "#7B9EF2", "label": "x terms" },
    "constant": { "hex": "#F2A87B", "label": "constants" },
    "result": { "hex": "#7BF2B0", "label": "result" },
    "highlight": { "hex": "#F2E57B", "label": "emphasis" }
  },
  "scenes": [ "..." ]
}
```

### Scene Structure

```json
{
  "id": "scene_1",
  "title": "Rearranging the equation",
  "steps": [ "..." ]
}
```

### Step Structure (core unit of animation)

Each step represents one "beat" of the lesson — a narration + equation state + canvas state + animations.

```json
{
  "id": "step_1",
  "duration": 2500,
  "narration": {
    "text": "We move the constant to the right-hand side by subtracting 5 from both sides.",
    "style": "typewriter"
  },
  "equation": {
    "before": "{{x_sq|x^2}} + {{three_x|3x}} + {{five|5}} = {{zero|0}}",
    "after": "{{x_sq|x^2}} + {{three_x|3x}} = {{neg_five|-5}}",
    "colorMap": {
      "x_sq": "x_term",
      "three_x": "x_term",
      "five": "constant",
      "zero": "constant",
      "neg_five": "constant"
    }
  },
  "canvas": {
    "viewport": { "xRange": [-5, 5], "yRange": [-3, 10] },
    "objects": [
      {
        "id": "parabola",
        "type": "function",
        "expression": "x^2 + 3*x + 5",
        "color": "x_term",
        "strokeWidth": 2
      },
      {
        "id": "vertex",
        "type": "point",
        "coords": [-1.5, 2.75],
        "label": "vertex",
        "color": "highlight",
        "draggable": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "animations": [
    {
      "type": "equation-morph",
      "transitions": [
        { "termId": "five", "action": "move-across-equals", "becomesId": "neg_five" },
        { "termId": "zero", "action": "fade-out" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "canvas-highlight",
      "targetId": "vertex",
      "effect": "pulse",
      "delay": 1000
    }
  ],
  "interactive": {
    "sliders": [],
    "draggablePoints": []
  }
}
```

### Equation Tagged Format

Equations use a `{{id|latex}}` tagged format (inspired by Manim's `{{ }}` grouping):

- `{{x_sq|x^2}}` — term with id `x_sq`, rendered as `x^2`
- The engine extracts each tagged term, renders them as separate KaTeX SVG groups
- During morph, terms with matching IDs slide to their new positions
- Terms that disappear fade out; new terms fade in
- `move-across-equals` triggers the signature "slide across + sign change" animation

### Canvas Object Types

| Type | Properties | Description |
|------|-----------|-------------|
| `function` | `expression`, `color`, `domain`, `strokeWidth`, `dashed` | Plotted curve |
| `vector` | `from`, `to`, `color`, `label`, `showComponents` | Arrow vector |
| `point` | `coords`, `color`, `label`, `draggable`, `radius` | Point marker |
| `line` | `from`, `to`, `color`, `label`, `extend` | Line segment or ray |
| `circle` | `center`, `radius`, `color`, `fill`, `fillOpacity` | Circle shape |
| `polygon` | `vertices`, `color`, `fill`, `fillOpacity` | Polygon shape |
| `angle` | `vertex`, `ray1`, `ray2`, `color`, `label`, `showArc` | Angle annotation |
| `area` | `function`, `xRange`, `color`, `fillOpacity` | Shaded region under curve |
| `label` | `coords`, `text`, `color`, `fontSize` | Text annotation |
| `brace` | `from`, `to`, `label`, `direction` | Curly brace annotation |
| `matrix` | `values`, `rowColors`, `highlightCells` | Matrix grid display |
| `numberLine` | `range`, `ticks`, `points`, `color` | 1D number line |

### Animation Types

| Type | Target | Description |
|------|--------|-------------|
| `equation-morph` | equation | Transform equation from before → after state with term matching |
| `equation-write` | equation | Write out equation character by character |
| `equation-highlight` | term | Pulse/glow a specific term |
| `equation-annotate` | term | Add underline, overline, or brace to term |
| `equation-substitute` | term | Replace variable with value |
| `equation-cancel` | terms | Strikethrough matching terms |
| `canvas-draw` | object | Trace an object from start to end (ShowCreation) |
| `canvas-fade-in` | object | Fade in with optional scale |
| `canvas-fade-out` | object | Fade out |
| `canvas-translate` | object | Slide to new position |
| `canvas-transform` | object | Morph one object into another |
| `canvas-add-vector` | vectors | Tip-to-tail vector addition |
| `canvas-shade` | area | Gradually fill an area |
| `canvas-trace` | point + path | Point moves along path leaving trail |
| `camera-pan` | viewport | Shift the visible region |
| `camera-zoom` | viewport | Change the zoom level |
| `matrix-row-swap` | matrix | Animate two rows swapping positions |
| `matrix-row-scale` | matrix | Highlight and multiply a row |
| `matrix-row-add` | matrix | Combine rows with animation |
| `group-animations` | multiple | Run animations in parallel |
| `sequence-animations` | multiple | Run animations in sequence |

