## UI Design — Obsidian Editorial Aesthetic

### Design Tokens

```css
/* Colour palette */
--bg-primary: #1a1a2e;        /* deep navy background */
--bg-secondary: #16213e;      /* elevated surfaces */
--bg-surface: #1f2b47;        /* cards, panels */
