```

### Key UI Principles

- **No emojis** — use Lucide icons only (chevrons, play/pause, settings gear, grid, menu)
- **Minimal chrome** — content is the hero, controls recede when not needed
- **Glassmorphism cards** — equation and narration float over the canvas with subtle backdrop-blur
- **Monochrome + accent** — dark background, white text, blue accent, colours only for math semantics
- **Smooth transitions** — Framer Motion `layout` animations for all UI state changes
- **Focus mode** — controls auto-hide after 3s of inactivity during playback, reappear on hover/touch

