## Phased Implementation Roadmap

### Phase 1 — Foundation (Target: 3-4 days)
- [ ] Vite + React + TypeScript scaffold
- [ ] Design system: CSS tokens, Inter font, Obsidian dark theme
- [ ] UI shell: top bar, routing (Library / Viewer / Import)
- [ ] Lucide icon integration
- [ ] Lesson JSON TypeScript types (`engine/types.ts`)
- [ ] Lesson parser with JSON validation
- [ ] Basic lesson viewer layout (equation area + canvas area + narration + controls)

### Phase 2 — Equation Rendering & Morphing (Target: 4-5 days)
- [ ] KaTeX integration with SVG output
- [ ] Tagged equation parser (`{{id|latex}}` format)
- [ ] Term-level colour application
- [ ] Equation write animation (character-by-character reveal)
- [ ] Equation morph engine (term matching, position diff, GSAP animation)
- [ ] Move-term-across-equals animation with sign change
- [ ] Highlight / pulse / underline / brace term annotations
- [ ] Anti-overlap: collision detection for equation annotations

### Phase 3 — Canvas Rendering (Target: 4-5 days)
- [ ] Mafs integration as canvas renderer
- [ ] Function plotting from expression strings (via math.js)
- [ ] Vector arrows with labels
- [ ] Points (static and draggable)
- [ ] Lines, circles, polygons
- [ ] Area shading (under curves)
- [ ] ShowCreation trace animation (draw path progressively)
- [ ] Canvas fade-in/fade-out/translate animations
- [ ] Camera pan and zoom (Mafs viewport control)
- [ ] Label collision avoidance

### Phase 4 — Timeline & Transport (Target: 3-4 days)
- [ ] GSAP master timeline coordinating all renderers
- [ ] Transport bar: play / pause / step-forward / step-back
- [ ] Progress scrubber with step markers
- [ ] Speed selector (0.25x to 2x)
- [ ] Scene/step navigation
- [ ] Keyboard shortcuts (Space, Left/Right arrows, +/- for speed)
- [ ] Auto-hide controls during playback

### Phase 5 — Interactivity (Target: 3-4 days)
- [ ] Interactive mode toggle (pauses auto-play)
- [ ] Parameter sliders with live canvas/equation updates
- [ ] Draggable points with dependent object recalculation
- [ ] Hover cross-referencing: equation term highlights graph element and vice versa
- [ ] Matrix renderer with row operation animations

### Phase 6 — Test Cases & Polish (Target: 3-4 days)
- [ ] Author all 7 baseline test case lesson JSONs
- [ ] Visual verification of each test case
- [ ] Lesson importer view (JSON editor + file upload + validation)
- [ ] Lesson library view (grid of example cards)
- [ ] Schema reference / AI prompt template view
- [ ] localStorage persistence for saved lessons
- [ ] Responsive layout (desktop-first, functional on tablet)
- [ ] Performance audit and optimisation

